  "description": "The Streamway is all about knocking down barriers. If traditional bicycles with limited stand-over clearance take the fun out of riding for you, the Streamway is here to help. We removed the traditional top tube found on most bikes to create a wide open step-through area for easy on and off the bike access. It's ready to handle trips to the market, coffee shop, and bike paths in your neighborhood.\nLightweight 6061 aluminum easy step-through frame\nAlloy crankset with sealed cartridge bottom bracket\nAlloy rims with stainless steel spokes\n26 x 2.125\" Duro Easy Ride tires\nClassic city handlebar and adjustable angle alloy stem\nSun comfort saddle\nSteel chain guard and plastic fenders\nAlloy kickstand",
